  "changes_html": "<h2>About This Vintage</h2><p>This is a historical reconstruction of The Budget Lab's \"State of U.S. Tariffs: January 19, 2026\" report, restructured to match the current interactive's data format. The \"Current Policy\" scenario reflects tariff policy as it stood on January 19, 2026; the \"With Greenland Tariffs\" scenario models the counterfactual in which new tariffs on Greenland-linked goods are NOT imposed.</p>",
